  - m_Id: 1605015900160
    m_Localized: Reset|Remove all Pieces from the board and refund their cost in
      credits. Then, double your current credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1605099786240
    m_Localized: Angel's Descent|Gain 1 Angel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1605099786241
    m_Localized: Wisdom|Max Action Count increased by 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1605099786242
    m_Localized: Alchemist|Instantly and at the start of each stage, gain a random
      item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1605103980544
    m_Localized: Energy Overflow|At the start of combat, restore all allies' Mana
      to maximum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1605103980545
    m_Localized: The Couple|Instantly gain 1 King and 1 Queen. At the start of each
      turn, restore 1 Mana to a random King or Queen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1605103980546
    m_Localized: BattleCry|At the start of each turn, grant +1 Attack to a random
      2 allies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1605103980547
    m_Localized: Healing Aura|At the start of each turn, restore 1 HP to all allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1605103980548
    m_Localized: Mystic Ground|At the start of each turn, restore 1 Mana to a random
      ally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1605103980549
    m_Localized: Blighted Ground|At the start of each turn, deal 1 damage to all
      units, and 2 damage to enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1605103980550
    m_Localized: Temporary Promotion|At the start of combat, increase the level of
      3 random allies by 1 for the rest of the battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 317407338369024
    m_Localized: Piggy Bank|Instantly gain 50 credits. Gain an additional 20 credits
